--- !u!114 &403260740
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 403260738}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\U0001F50D Objective:\n\nTo separate a mixture of salt and water using
    the evaporation method.\n\n\U0001F4A1 Theory:\n\nA solution is a homogeneous
    mixture of two or more substances.\n\nIn a salt-water solution, salt (solute)
    is dissolved in water (solvent).\n\nEvaporation is a method used to separate
    a soluble solid from a liquid.\n\nBy heating, water evaporates, and salt is left
    behind in the container.\n\nThis method utilizes the difference in boiling points
    of water and salt.\n\n\U0001F9EA Apparatus Used:\n\u2022 Beaker\n\u2022 Stirrer\n\u2022
    Wire Gauze\n\u2022 China Dish\n\u2022 Matchbox or Heat Source\n\u2022 Fire Source\n\u2022
    Salt and Water\n\n\U0001F52C Procedure:\n\nAdd salt to water in a beaker to form
    a salt-water solution.\n\nStir the solution thoroughly to dissolve the salt completely.\n\nTransfer
    the salt-water solution into a china dish.\n\nPlace the china dish on a wire
    gauze setup.\n\nHeat the dish gently using a matchbox or fire source.\n\nAllow
    the water to evaporate completely.\n\n\u2705 Observation:\n\nWater evaporates
    gradually due to heating.\n\nSalt crystals are left behind in the china dish.\n\n\U0001F4CC
    Conclusion:\n\nThe evaporation method successfully separates salt from water.\n\nThe
    process demonstrates a physical separation based on boiling points.\n\n\U0001F4D8
    Learning Outcomes:\n\u2022 Understand the concept of solute and solvent in a
    solution.\n\u2022 Learn how evaporation helps in separating a dissolved substance.\n\u2022
    Gain practical experience in performing chemical separation methods.\n\u2022
    Observe how heat aids in the separation of components."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2519903747605655627, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
