--- !u!114 &1423092683
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1423092681}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Objective:\nTo study the thermal decomposition reaction using a laboratory
    setup.\n\n\U0001F4A1 Theory:\n\nA decomposition reaction is a chemical change
    in which a single compound breaks down into two or more simpler substances.\n\nThermal
    decomposition is initiated by heating the substance, causing it to break down
    chemically.\n\nThis experiment demonstrates how heat can trigger the breakdown
    of a compound into simpler substances.\n\n\U0001F9EA Apparatus Used:\n\u2022
    Test Tube\n\u2022 Capillary Tube\n\u2022 Matchbox or Heat Source\n\u2022 Stand
    Setup and Fire Source\n\n\U0001F52C Procedure:\n\nTake the compound to be decomposed
    in a test tube.\n\nInsert a capillary tube to allow gas escape or collect any
    released gas.\n\nHeat the test tube gently using a matchbox or burner.\n\nObserve
    any changes in the compound, including gas release or color change.\n\n\u2705
    Observation:\n\nOn heating, the compound starts to decompose.\n\nGas bubbles
    may appear or the compound may change color, indicating a chemical reaction.\n\n\U0001F4CC
    Conclusion:\n\nA single compound breaks into simpler substances upon heating,
    confirming a thermal decomposition reaction.\n\nHeat acts as an energy source
    to break the bonds in the compound.\n\n\U0001F4D8 Learning Outcomes:\n\u2022
    Understand the concept of decomposition reactions.\n\u2022 Learn how heating
    causes chemical breakdown of compounds.\n\u2022 Observe gas evolution or physical
    changes during decomposition.\n\u2022 Familiarize with basic lab apparatus handling
    and heating safety."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2519903747605655627, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
