--- !u!114 &1888089820
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1888089818}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\U0001F50D Objective:\n\nTo prepare pure crystals of copper sulphate from
    an impure sample using crystallization technique.\n\n\U0001F4A1 Theory:\n\nCrystallization
    is a purification technique used to remove soluble impurities from a compound.\n\nWhen
    a hot saturated solution of copper sulphate is allowed to cool, pure crystals
    of copper sulphate form and separate from the solution.\n\nThis method is based
    on the difference in solubility of the substance and its impurities.\n\n\U0001F9EA
    Apparatus Used:\n\u2022 Beaker\n\u2022 China Dish\n\u2022 Glass Stirrer\n\u2022
    Copper Sulphate\n\u2022 Matchbox / Burner\n\u2022 Evaporating Setup\n\n\U0001F52C
    Procedure:\n\nDissolve copper sulphate in water to prepare a saturated solution.\n\nStir
    the solution thoroughly using a glass stirrer.\n\nFilter the solution to remove
    insoluble impurities (if any).\n\nPour the filtered solution into a china dish.\n\nHeat
    the solution gently using a burner to evaporate some water.\n\nAllow the solution
    to cool undisturbed.\n\nObserve the formation of pure blue crystals of copper
    sulphate.\n\n\u2705 Observation:\n\nBlue crystals of copper sulphate form after
    the hot saturated solution cools.\n\n\U0001F4CC Conclusion:\n\nCrystallization
    is an effective method to purify copper sulphate.\n\nImpurities remain dissolved
    in water while pure crystals settle separately.\n\n\U0001F4D8 Learning Outcomes:\n\u2022
    Understand the process of crystallization.\n\u2022 Learn laboratory handling
    of hot saturated solutions.\n\u2022 Observe the formation of pure crystals.\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2519903747605655627, guid: 7d383cc1211c7a447bf206169c33c84c, type: 2}
